  "description": "CR 702.129a eternalize makes a black 4/4 Zombie token copy, and neither it nor a Clone of it is a Doom Blade target",
  "note": "Proven Combatant, a blue 1/1 Human Warrior with a mana cost, eternalized into a 4/4 black Zombie token with none (CR 707.9b), and a Clone of the token takes the exceptions with it. Doom Blade (\"Destroy target nonblack creature\") is the reader for colour: with only the token and its Clone out it is not offered (CR 601.2c), and once a Proven Combatant is cast beside them it is, so the first read means the copies are black rather than that the Blade is uncastable. Displacement Wave for X = 0 reads the mana values: it returns the token and its Clone, both mana value 0 (CR 202.3a), and leaves the cast Combatant, mana value 1.",
